<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/agents/discipline-reviewer.md/s007/b42> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/agents/discipline-reviewer.md/s007> ;
